#: includes/modules/pricing/functions-part-payments.php:180
msgid ""
"You can charge a deposit and receive the rest of the amount in cash, or ask "
"for the final payment to be done online using the same method (eg. PayPal or"
" Stripe) as the initial payment, for which you will have some extra options "
"below."
